      "comment" : "Lock Screen one-line form. Last Dose widget: the item name and the time, for example \"Vitamin D, 2 hr. ago\" (D108). Next Dose widget: the time and the names, for example \"8:00 AM, Vitamin D and Iron\" (D113).",
