    "Couldn’t confirm the save. Open Maru to check." : {
      "comment" : "Live Activity: the text after a tap on Taken when the record did not confirm. The dose can be stored, so the text does not say that nothing was recorded (spec 7.2, D014, D110).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Speichern nicht bestätigt. Öffne Maru zum Prüfen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo confirmar que se guardó. Abre Maru para revisarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存を確認できませんでした。Maruを開いて確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "저장을 확인하지 못했어요. Maru를 열어 확인해 주세요."
